{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d93b71ff-d7ea-8f56-aece-7d2c3c61c298",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T13:31:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I'm calling about the snow. The plow came down my street and now the bus stop is all buried. [pause] Hold on, I have the phone on my shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Which bus stop is it, and what street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right at the corner by my house. 318 Dean Avenue. The snow is piled up, it's like a wall, higher than my knees. Nobody can get to the bus, and the, um, the sidewalk is gone too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 318 Dean Avenue, and the bus stop is covered by the snow the plow pushed up. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. The plow pushed it all over there. I need somebody to come back and clear it. Just a, a little bit, where people stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for a plow to come back to that corner. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neusa Monteiro. M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O. [pause] Sorry, I dropped my glasses, one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush. Monteiro, M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O. And is this the number you're calling from, in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's the house phone. 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0197. And I'll need the zip code for the address, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it's 02480. No wait, you said it, hmm. Zero two eight, four, zero. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 318 Dean Avenue, zero two eight four zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds right. [pause] No, wait. Newport is zero two eight four, zero. That's what you said. Oh, I'm sorry, I heard it wrong, I thought you said something else before. Zero two eight four zero is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, we have it as zero two eight four zero. So that's Neusa Monteiro, 318 Dean Avenue, snow piled over the bus stop at the corner, and you'd like a plow to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. The buses are still running, so the people are standing out in the street. It's not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I agree, that's not a safe spot to wait. I'll send this to the plow crew supervisor today. They're working through a lot of requests, but corners with bus stops get looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do I need to call again or does somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You don't need to call again. If they have a question about the spot, they'll use that number. If the snow is still there in a couple of days, call us back and we'll check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you very much. [pause] Sorry, the kettle. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:31:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Monteiro. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
